## 7️⃣ Methods vs. Functions Summary
==================================


| Aspect         | Function                                                  | Method                                  |
| -------------- | --------------------------------------------        | --------------------------------------- |
| Definition     | Independent reusable code block                  | Function inside an object               |
| How to call    | `functionName()`                                       | `objectName.methodName()`               |
| Access to data | Can't access object properties unless passed  | Can access object properties via `this` |
| Example        | `function sayHi() {}`                                   | `let obj = { sayHi() {} }`              |

